OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will push northwards during the
OL,7,Fevening, heavy at times. Drier and
OL,8,Fclearer conditions returning from the
OL,9,Fwest overnight. Breezy around the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FDry and bright with some
OL,13,Fsunny spells in the morning. Cloud
OL,14,Fincreasing with occasional rain or
OL,15,Fshowers during the afternoon, the rain
OL,16,Fturning persistent and occasionally
OL,17,Fheavy in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
